    <title>如何卸载OpenClaw</title>
    <link href="https://blogbu2154.site/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E5%8D%B8%E8%BD%BDOpenClaw/"/>
    <id>https://blogbu2154.site/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E5%8D%B8%E8%BD%BDOpenClaw/</id>
    <published>2026-03-19T05:26:00.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-03-19T05:31:17.355Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<blockquote><p>⚠️ <strong>警告</strong>：卸载是一个<strong>不可逆</strong>的操作，请谨慎操作。</p></blockquote><blockquote><p>⚠️ <strong>注意</strong>：以下内容是<strong>基于官方文档</strong>编写的，我让openclaw自己写的，卸载前请确保你了解每一步的作用。</p><p>官方文档参考：<a href="https://openclaw.ai/docs/install/uninstall">https://openclaw.ai/docs/install/uninstall</a></p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="方法一：CLI-仍在（推荐）"><a href="#方法一：CLI-仍在（推荐）" class="headerlink" title="方法一：CLI 仍在（推荐）"></a>方法一：CLI 仍在（推荐）</h2><p>如果你的电脑上还能运行 <code>openclaw</code> 命令，使用官方内置的卸载工具。</p><h3 id="交互式卸载"><a href="#交互式卸载" class="headerlink" title="交互式卸载"></a>交互式卸载</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">openclaw uninstall</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="非交互式卸载（自动化脚本用）"><a href="#非交互式卸载（自动化脚本用）" class="headerlink" title="非交互式卸载（自动化脚本用）"></a>非交互式卸载（自动化脚本用）</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">openclaw uninstall --all --<span class="built_in">yes</span> --non-interactive</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>或者如果没安装 CLI：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npx -y openclaw uninstall --all --<span class="built_in">yes</span> --non-interactive</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="方法二：手动卸载（一步一步来）"><a href="#方法二：手动卸载（一步一步来）" class="headerlink" title="方法二：手动卸载（一步一步来）"></a>方法二：手动卸载（一步一步来）</h2><p>如果你无法运行 <code>openclaw</code> 命令，或者想手动清理每个部分，请按以下步骤操作。</p><h3 id="1-停止-Gateway-服务"><a href="#1-停止-Gateway-服务" class="headerlink" title="1. 停止 Gateway 服务"></a>1. 停止 Gateway 服务</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">openclaw gateway stop</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>⚠️ 如果 CLI 已经不可用，跳过这一步。</p></blockquote><h3 id="2-卸载-Gateway-服务"><a href="#2-卸载-Gateway-服务" class="headerlink" title="2. 卸载 Gateway 服务"></a>2. 卸载 Gateway 服务</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">openclaw gateway uninstall</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="3-删除状态和配置文件"><a href="#3-删除状态和配置文件" class="headerlink" title="3. 删除状态和配置文件"></a>3. 删除状态和配置文件</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 默认路径</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">rm</span> -rf <span class="string">&quot;<span class="variable">$&#123;OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR:-<span class="variable">$HOME</span>/.openclaw&#125;</span>&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 如果你使用了自定义配置路径，也需要删除</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 如果你设置了 OPENCLAW_CONFIG_PATH，删掉那个文件</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>⚠️ <strong>注意</strong>：这会删除所有聊天记录、配置、API 密钥等数据！</p></blockquote><h3 id="4-删除工作区（可选）"><a href="#4-删除工作区（可选）" class="headerlink" title="4. 删除工作区（可选）"></a>4. 删除工作区（可选）</h3><p>如果你想删除所有 agent 文件和对话历史：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">rm</span> -rf ~/.openclaw/workspace</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="5-删除-CLI"><a href="#5-删除-CLI" class="headerlink" title="5. 删除 CLI"></a>5. 删除 CLI</h3><p>根据你当初的安装方式选择：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># npm 安装</span></span><br><span class="line">npm <span class="built_in">rm</span> -g openclaw</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># pnpm 安装</span></span><br><span class="line">pnpm remove -g openclaw</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># bun 安装</span></span><br><span class="line">bun remove -g openclaw</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="6-删除-macOS-App（如果你用了-macOS-版）"><a href="#6-删除-macOS-App（如果你用了-macOS-版）" class="headerlink" title="6. 删除 macOS App（如果你用了 macOS 版）"></a>6. 删除 macOS App（如果你用了 macOS 版）</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">rm</span> -rf /Applications/OpenClaw.app</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="方法三：CLI-已删除但服务仍在运行"><a href="#方法三：CLI-已删除但服务仍在运行" class="headerlink" title="方法三：CLI 已删除但服务仍在运行"></a>方法三：CLI 已删除但服务仍在运行</h2><p>有些情况下，你卸载了 CLI 但 Gateway 服务仍在后台运行。</p><h3 id="macOS-launchd"><a href="#macOS-launchd" class="headerlink" title="macOS (launchd)"></a>macOS (launchd)</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 停止服务</span></span><br><span class="line">launchctl bootout gui/<span class="variable">$UID</span>/ai.openclaw.gateway</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 删除启动配置</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">rm</span> -f ~/Library/LaunchAgents/ai.openclaw.gateway.plist</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 如果你用过自定义 profile</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 把 ai.openclaw.gateway 改成 ai.openclaw.&lt;你的profile名&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="Linux-systemd"><a href="#Linux-systemd" class="headerlink" title="Linux (systemd)"></a>Linux (systemd)</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 停止并禁用服务</span></span><br><span class="line">systemctl --user <span class="built_in">disable</span> --now openclaw-gateway.service</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 删除服务文件</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">rm</span> -f ~/.config/systemd/user/openclaw-gateway.service</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 重新加载 systemd</span></span><br><span class="line">systemctl --user daemon-reload</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="Windows-计划任务"><a href="#Windows-计划任务" class="headerlink" title="Windows (计划任务)"></a>Windows (计划任务)</h3><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 删除计划任务</span></span><br><span class="line">schtasks /Delete /F /TN <span class="string">&quot;OpenClaw Gateway&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 删除服务脚本</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">Remove-Item</span> <span class="literal">-Force</span> <span class="string">&quot;<span class="variable">$env:USERPROFILE</span>\.openclaw\gateway.cmd&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="常见问题"><a href="#常见问题" class="headerlink" title="常见问题"></a>常见问题</h2><p><strong>Q: 卸载后想重装怎么办？</strong></p><p>重新运行安装命令即可：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Windows</span></span><br><span class="line">iwr -useb https://openclaw.ai/install.ps1 | iex</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># macOS / Linux</span></span><br><span class="line">curl -fsSL https://openclaw.ai/install.sh | bash</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>Q: 之前用了 <code>--profile</code> 怎么办？</strong></p><p>每个 profile 都有独立的状态目录，如 <code>~/.openclaw-&lt;profile&gt;</code>，需要手动删除：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">rm</span> -rf ~/.openclaw-&lt;你的profile名&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><p>如有问题，欢迎在评论区留言！ 🦞🐨</p>]]></content>
    
    
      
      
